{# Block 6, earlier and now (NPC §7.3): the previous conversation's last shown lines under a fixed header, then this
   conversation's completed exchanges, the Tarnished's words quoted as user, the persona's shown words as assistant.
   The header says things have moved on when the persona's stage then differs from now (MEM §4.3).
   At most 900 tokens; trimmed first, oldest first, keeping the last two exchanges. #}
{% if not empty(earlier) %}
[ user ]
{% if earlier_moved_on %}
Earlier, when you last spoke with the Tarnished (things have moved on since):
{% else %}
Earlier, when you last spoke with the Tarnished:
{% endif %}
{% for line in earlier %}
{% if line.tarnished %}The Tarnished: {{ quote(line.text) }}{% else %}You: {{ quote(line.text) }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% for turn in history %}
{% if turn.tarnished %}
[ user ]
The Tarnished: {{ quote(turn.text) }}
{% else %}
[ assistant ]
{{ turn.text }}
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
